# The wasm gate's games (STU_WASM=1 only, never shipped): device/standin/wasm.txt runs it through the keys with
# STU_WASM=1 GAMES_LIST=games-wasm-gate.list device/standin/run.sh PORT device/standin/wasm.txt. BABLW is Babal
# built as WebAssembly, the same game as native BABAL; TRAP's key 1 recurses without end, which the bridge's
# stack guard must trap (soroban #5501). Format: games.list.
